## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of streaming architectures under load, including partitioning, backpressure, and correctness guarantees (exactly-once) in the presence of late data and failures.

## Key Concepts

- Backpressure and bounded queues
- Partitioning by key for ordering guarantees
