## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant FIFO queues
- Global bounded backlog with backpressure signaling
- Dynamic quotas via token buckets adjusted by observed burstiness
- Scheduling policy (weighted RR) to prevent starvation
- Observability: per-tenant throughput, latency, and starvation windows

